dcap-qvl 0.6.1 (vendored)
========================

Source and README were copied from the published dcap-qvl 0.6.1 crate,
https://crates.io/crates/dcap-qvl, by Kevin Wang and Phala Network, under the
MIT license in this directory. The verification source is unchanged.

The Cargo manifest was narrowed to the offline native verification features
used by aptos-tinfoil-v3: std, ring, and default-x509. The unused unconditional
wasm-bindgen-futures dependency, Python/JS/network/RustCrypto feature
dependencies, upstream integration tests and development dependencies, and
package-local release profile were removed. No network fetcher is built.
